### GET request to example server
GET https://examples.http-client.intellij.net/get
    ?generated-in=IntelliJ IDEA

### =========================
### USER
### =========================

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:8080/users

### Get one user
GET http://localhost:8080/users/3

### Create user
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "mariem",
  "email": "mear@example.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "confirmPassword": "123456",
  "image": "mari.png",
  "collectionRequestDTOList": [],
  "groupRequestDTOList": [],
  "libraryEntryRequestDTOList": [],
  "reviewRequestDTOList": []
}

### Update user
PUT http://localhost:8080/users/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newMariem",
  "email": "newemail@example.com",
  "password": "8888",
  "confirmPassword": "8888",
  "image": "meary5.png",
  "collectionRequestDTOList": [],
  "groupRequestDTOList": [],
  "libraryEntryRequestDTOList": [],
  "reviewRequestDTOList": []
}

### Delete user
DELETE http://localhost:8080/users/4



### =========================
### WORK
### =========================

### Get all works
GET http://localhost:8080/works

### Get one work
GET http://localhost:8080/works/2

### Create work
POST http://localhost:8080/works
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Steve Jobs",
  "image": "steve.jpg",
  "originalPubYear": 2012,
  "authorRequestDTOList": []
}

### Update work
PUT http://localhost:8080/works/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Steve Jobs Updated",
  "image": "new-image.jpg",
  "originalPubYear": 2012,
  "authorRequestDTOList": []
}

### Delete work
DELETE http://localhost:8080/works/1



